## 2. Syllabus Modernization: BUS 700 Orientation Seminar

| Assignment Component | Legacy Approach (BUS 700)[cite: 7] | Belhaven AI Policy Compliant Addendum |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Literature Review & Search** | Manual database searches via Google Scholar[cite: 7]. | **AI Search Optimization:** Permitted for query generation; requires primary source verification to prevent hallucinated citations[cite: 1, 5, 7]. |
| **Research Question Ideation** | Manual drafting based on core texts[cite: 7]. | **Socratic Prompting:** Permitted with mandatory submission of an **AI Use Statement** outlining tool contribution[cite: 3, 5, 7]. |
| **Writing & Formatting** | Strict adherence to APA 7th Edition[cite: 7]. | **Mechanical Assistance:** Grammar tools permitted; text generation requires explicit APA 2026 LLM reference citations[cite: 3, 4]. |
| **Research Ethics & Data Security** | CITI Human Subjects Training completion[cite: 7]. | **FERPA Guardrails:** Strict prohibition on entering unreleased research, personal data, or human subject data into LLMs[cite: 1, 7]. |

