## 5. Standardized Mandatory AI Disclosure Protocol

Students utilizing generative AI on permitted assignments must include both an **AI Use Statement** endnote and an **APA Reference Citation**[cite: 3, 4]:

**Mandatory Endnote Disclosure Format:**
> *"Generative AI (OpenAI ChatGPT) was used during the planning, organization, and editing of this paper. All analysis, conclusions, and final content were reviewed, revised, and accepted by the author, who assumes responsibility for the accuracy and originality of the submitted work."*[cite: 3, 4, 5]

**APA Reference Citation Examples:**
* **OpenAI:** OpenAI. (2026). *ChatGPT (GPT-5.5)* [Large language model]. https://chatgpt.com[cite: 4]
* **Anthropic:** Anthropic. (2026). *Claude* [Large language model]. https://claude.ai[cite: 4]
* **Google:** Google. (2026). *Gemini* [Large language model]. https://gemini.google.com[cite: 4]

