## 6. Implementation & Faculty Action Plan
* **Syllabus Integration:** Embed explicit AI permission levels (Permitted, Restricted, Prohibited) and disclosure templates in every course syllabus[cite: 1, 3].
* **Evidence-Based Evaluation:** Require draft histories, outline notes, or brief oral discussions before initiating formal academic integrity reports[cite: 1, 2, 3].
* **Documentation Safeguards:** Include complete records of faculty-student discussions and elected response options (Options 1–5 or A–C) when submitting AI Infraction reports[cite: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5].
